  "date": "2026-11-18",
  "title": "Of 241 real single-line edits in four real projects, 48.6% need only material the site already has, and 0.4% need a name it does not: the insufficiency is SHAPE, not names",
  "where_the_data_is_from": {
    "projects": [
      "click",
      "httpx",
      "requests",
      "tqdm"
    ],
    "source": "git history of github.com/psf/requests, pallets/click, tqdm/tqdm, encode/httpx, cloned at run time; every commit whose whole diff for one Python file is one removed and one added line",
    "why_this_population": "it is the population a single-site expression replacement can address, so it is the population the question is about"
  },
  "numbers": {
    "single_line_edits_examined": 241,
    "in_vocabulary": 117,
